{
  "$schema": "vehicles",
  "$comment": "Parametric vehicle silhouettes. gen/vehicles.js extrudes a body from these numbers and bolts on four wheels — no models. `jitter` is the ± fraction each dimension may vary per instance so no two cars on a street are identical. Handling is arcade: grip, drift on handbrake, soft speed cap, cosmetic damage only.",

